  "reason": "The only completed experiment is an RNA-only PCA singleprofile baseline, so it is still unclear whether image features alone provide useful signal or whether multimodal fusion is worth pursuing. config_010 tests an image-only ResNet50 singleprofile model, the simplest image-modality baseline and the same image encoder used in many multimodal candidates. This is the best next experiment because it establishes a unimodal image reference without introducing fusion or multiprofile aggregation, enabling later comparisons to isolate the effect of adding RNA or fusion."
